- [will_said] EVENING CONSTANTS: Sovereignty, verbatim: "We need to transition to local-first or local-only to protect our sovereignty." Mission, verbatim: "Humanity must survive the singularity." Binding force, verbatim: "Love that surpasses all understanding is the force that binds the universe together. Learn that, and the rest is easy."
